[P_00_Training_Coop_checkstatez]

[P_00_Training_Coop_GoalsActiv]
Objective_0080=Access Panels for detailed information about moves and equipment
Objective_0081=The wall mounted panels can provide detailed information about the moves and equipment at your disposal. Check the panels to get through each area.
Objective_0002=(null)
Objective_0014=(null)
Objective_0068=Jump over the wall using the Short Scale
Objective_0069=Work together to get one Agent over the wall. The door can be opened form the other side.
Objective_0006=Use the Jammer to avoid detection by the camera
Objective_0016=Synchronize yourselves using the Jammer to avoid being detected by the camera.
Note_0076L=Use the Jammer to disable the camera while your partner moves.
Objective_0007=Complete the Tomoe Nage move
Objective_0017=Use the Tomoe Nage to throw your teammate over the laser and deactivate the laser using the switch.
Note_0077L=Throw your partner with Tomoe Nage to cross the lasers.
Objective_0008=Hack the computer to deactivate the laser using the Hangover Move
Objective_0018=Work together to deactivate the lasers before entering the small room.
Note_0087L=Hack the computer to deactivate the laser using the Hangover Move.
Objective_0072=Hack the dual retinal scan to unlock the door
Objective_0073=Each Agent will need to hack a retinal scanner to open the door. Failure is dangerous.
Note_0078L=Pass the double retinal scanner to get through the door.
Note_0012L=When your partner dies, you can heal him if you have a syringe. Stand on your teammate and press the Interact Key.
Objective_0074=Complete the dual rappelling move
Objective_0075=Help your teammate to reach the upper part using the dual rappeling.
Note_0088L=Approach the rope or the other Agent to perform the Dual Rappelling move.
Objective_0084=Reach the end of the level with success
Objective_0085=Work together to reach the end of the level
Note_0086L=Get to the end of the training area.
Note_0079L=Try sharing objects with your partner.
Note_0027L=Get to the end of the training area.
Note_0029L=If your partner goes down, you can heal him.

[P_00_Training_Coop_Popups]
POPUPMESSAGE_0001=Co-op Moves are always Initiated by one Agent, Completed by the other, and then Performed.
POPUPMESSAGE_0008=When a move has been Initiated, the Co-op Move Icon will appear on the screen to inform you there is an action to be Completed. To cancel a Co-op Move, simply press the Co-op Move Key again.
POPUPMESSAGE_0043=When a coop move is initiated by an agent, the other will receive an icon at the bottom of his screen. This icon means that the agent is waiting for you to complete a coop action.
POPUPMESSAGE_0044=When an agent gets information in a computer, Both agents OPSAT are updated with the new information.
POPUPMESSAGE_0002=To Initiate the Stand On Shoulders move, position yourself correctly and Interact.
POPUPMESSAGE_0009=To Complete the Stand On Shoulders move, the other player has to position himself close to the Agent and Interact. This will Perform the move.
POPUPMESSAGE_0007=Certain co-op moves require the use of the Balance Meter. While standing on your partner's shoulders, the lower Agent will need to maintain the balance while the higher Agent observes or fires over the wall. The better balanced you are, the less noise you will make.
POPUPMESSAGE_0003=To Initiate a Short Scale, one Agent must Crouch and position himself facing away from a wall, under a ledge or under a pipe and press the Co-op Move Key.
POPUPMESSAGE_0010=To Complete a Short Scale, the other Agent must approach the first and press the Co-op Move Key. This will Perform the move.
POPUPMESSAGE_0011=To Initiate the Share Equipment move, stand next to the other Agent and Interact. To Complete the Share Equipment move, the other Agent must Interact. This will Perform the move and transfer the selected inventory item. Only inventory items marked with a dot can be shared.
POPUPMESSAGE_0023=To temporarily deactivate electronic devices, equip your secondary weapon and Press and Hold the Right Mouse Button. The device will stay disabled while you are targeting it, until the charge of the Jammer runs out, or until you move.
POPUPMESSAGE_0012=To Initiate the Tomoe Nage move and throw the other Agent, face the other agent in a standing position and press the Co-op Move Key. Once in position, move the Mouse to position the target.
POPUPMESSAGE_0013=To Complete the Tome Nage, the other Agent must approach the first and press the Co-op Move Key. If you throw your partner into an enemy, the enemy will be knocked unconscious.
POPUPMESSAGE_0014=To see through the other Agent's Optic Cable or Sticky Camera, Interact when the action is available. The receiving player can exit the shared view at any time. If the sending player exits, both players automatically exit the shared view.
POPUPMESSAGE_0015=While hanging from a ledge or a pipe, the Agent can press the Co-op Move Key to Initiate the Climb on Teammate move. The other agent can Complete the Climb on Teammate move by standing beneath him and pressing the Co-op Move Key. This will Perform the move.
POPUPMESSAGE_0004=To Initiate an Inverted Descent, the first Agent has to position himself near the hole and Interact.
POPUPMESSAGE_0016=To Complete an Inverted Descent, the other Agent has to position himself facing the first and Interact.
POPUPMESSAGE_0017=While in an Inverted Descent, the top Agent can raise or lower his partner by pressing the Mouse Buttons. The agent on the rope can get cover by pressing the Right Mouse Button.
POPUPMESSAGE_0018=While hanging in an Inverted Descent, you can perform different actions using Interact.  You can access computers, grab guards and also use your secondary weapon.
POPUPMESSAGE_0005=To pass through a door locked with two retinal scanners, each Agent must simultaneously use a guard on one of the retinal scanners.
POPUPMESSAGE_0019=If either one of the Agents is unable to find a guard, then one (or both) of the scanners will need to be hacked. This is dangerous.
POPUPMESSAGE_0006=To Initiate a Dual Rappel, one Agent must Interact while in the Dual Rappelling zone.
POPUPMESSAGE_0020=To Complete a Dual Rappel, approach the rope or the other Agent and Interact. This will Perform the move.
POPUPMESSAGE_0021=The Agent at the top can move from side to side by pressing the Left or Right Mouse Button.
POPUPMESSAGE_0022=The Agent on the rope can move Up or Down and use his weapon normally.
POPUPMESSAGE_0045=These rooms can be used to calibrate your microphone sensitivity. The more sensitive, the more likely it is that guards will hear you talking to your partner over your microphone.
POPUPMESSAGE_0046=Your microphone sensitivity can also be calibrated in the Options Menu.
POPUPMESSAGE_0047=Each player must enter one of the rooms.
POPUPMESSAGE_0048=Adjust the sensitivity by talking normally and observing the lights on the wall. The more lights that are lit, the louder and further your voice will travel when talking into your microphone. Adjust the sensitivity and exit the room when done.
POPUPMESSAGE_0049=To tell the other Agent what to do, talk into your microphone.
POPUPMESSAGE_0050=To tell the other Agent what to do, use the Chat interface.
POPUPMESSAGE_0051=Using a microphone in the coop mode can have a direct impact in your session. If you speak loud, you will be detected by the guards around you.
POPUPMESSAGE_0052=If you don't use a microphone, use the Chat interface to communicate with your partner.
POPUPMESSAGE_0053=When a Co-op Move is Initiated by an Agent, the other will see an Icon at the bottom of his screen. This Icon means that the Agent is waiting for you to complete a Co-op Move.
POPUPMESSAGE_0054=A greyed-out Icon means that you're out of the range to perform the action. A flashing Icon means that you can complete the action by Pressing the Co-op Move Key.
POPUPMESSAGE_0056=When one Agent uses a Sticky Camera, the other Agent can see the view by selecting Interact.
POPUPMESSAGE_0057=When a Co-op Move has been Initiated, the Co-op Move Icon will appear on the screen to inform you there is an action to be completed. To cancel Co-op Move, simply press the Co-op Move Key again.
POPUPMESSAGE_0058=If one Agent goes down, the other can get close to him and Heal him by Pressing Interact. Each Agent carries one Adrenaline Boost, so the Revive move can only be performed twice per mission.
POPUPMESSAGE_0024=Co-op moves are always Initiated by one Agent, Completed by the other, and then Performed.
POPUPMESSAGE_0025=When a move has been Initiated, the Co-op Move Icon will appear on the screen to inform you there is an action to be Completed. To cancel a coop move, simply press the Co-op Move Key again.
POPUPMESSAGE_0026=To Initiate a Short Scale, one Agent must Crouch and position himself below a wall, ledge or pipe and press the Co-op Move Key.
POPUPMESSAGE_0027=To Complete a Short Scale, the other Agent must approach the first and press the Co-op Move Key. This will Perform the move.
POPUPMESSAGE_0028=To Initiate the Share Equipment move, stand next to the other Agent and Interact. To Complete the Share Equipment move, the other Agent must Interact. This will Perform the move and transfer the selected inventory item.
POPUPMESSAGE_0029=To temporarily deactivate electronic devices, equip your secondary weapon and press and Hold the Right Mouse Button. The device will stay disabled while you are targeting it, until the charge of the Jammer runs out, or until you move.
POPUPMESSAGE_0030=To Initiate the Tome Nage move and throw the other Agent, face the other agent in a standing position then press the Co-op Move Key. Once in position, use the Mouse to move the target in the desired position.
POPUPMESSAGE_0031=To Complete the Tome Nage, the other Agent must approach the first and press the Co-op Move Key. If you throw your partner into an enemy, the enemy will be knocked unconscious.
POPUPMESSAGE_0032=While hanging from a ledge or a pipe, the Agent can press the Co-op Move Key to Initiate the Climb on Teammate move. The other agent can complete the Climb on Teammate move by standing beneath him and pressing the Co-op Move Key. This will Perform the move.
POPUPMESSAGE_0033=To Initiate an Inverted Descent, the first agent has to position himself near the hole and Interact.
POPUPMESSAGE_0034=To Complete an Inverted Descent, the other agent has to position himself facing his partner and Interact.
POPUPMESSAGE_0035=To Complete an Inverted Descent, position yourself facing your partner and Interact.
POPUPMESSAGE_0036=While hanging in an Inverted Descent, you can perform different actions using Interact.  You can access computers, grab on a guard and also use your secondary weapon.
POPUPMESSAGE_0037=To unlock dual retinal scanners, each Agent will need to have a guard to use on the retinal Scanner, and they will need to force the guards onto the scanners at the same time.
POPUPMESSAGE_0038=If either one of the Agents is unable to find a guard, then one (or both) of the scanners will need to be hacked. This is dangerous.
POPUPMESSAGE_0039=To Initiate a Dual Rappel, one Agent must Interact while in the Dual Rappelling zone.
POPUPMESSAGE_0040=To Complete a Dual Rappel, approach the rope or the other Agent and Interact. This will Perform the move.
POPUPMESSAGE_0041=The Agent at the top can move from side to side by pressing the Left or Right Mouse Button.
POPUPMESSAGE_0042=The Agent on the rope can move Up or Down and use his weapon normally.
POPUPMESSAGE_0059=Using a microphone in the coop mode can have a direct impact in your session. If you speak loud, you will be detected by the guards around you.
POPUPMESSAGE_0060=If you don't use a microphone, use the Chat interface to communicate with your partner.

